{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53757","headline":"玉泉寺次韵寄白乐天刺史 · 僧初","name":"玉泉寺次韵寄白乐天刺史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古泉犹玉色，散木自闲身。\n挹秀寻芳躅，赓题步後尘。\n登山谢双屐，漉酒一陶巾。\n谁得向清净，居亭作主人。\n（见《古今禅藻集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}